menu "Cybiko emulator"
    config CYBIKO_CORE_IRAM
        bool "Run the Cybiko CPU core from internal RAM"
        default y
        help
            Place the H8S interpreter and the Cybiko machine's per-instruction
            paths (bus access, peripheral timing) in internal RAM, with real
            jump tables for their switch statements. From flash the 32 KB
            interpreter does not fit the 16 KB instruction cache, and ESP-IDF
            turns every switch into a chain of compares. Costs about 48 KB of
            internal RAM, which the Palm 68k JIT cache then does not get.
endmenu
